    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i dont really want a doctor or \"strategies\"... i just mean that everything feels so transparent. like, if i just stopped interacting with everything, would anything even change? it's like i'm just a ghost in a machine already. it feels much easier to just... fade out than to try and fight to be \"real\" again.",
