    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just that the \"help\" always feels like they're trying to pull me back into a world that i don't even recognize anymore. they want me to stay in this hollow shell. but if the world is just a simulation or a dream or whatever... why is it so wrong to want to just wake up from it? it feels like i'm just waiting for the screen to go dark anyway. it feels more peaceful than trying to pretend i'm a person.",
